"type":"text","text":"). Not the endpoint: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination appends "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"matomo.php"},{"type":"text","text":" itself."}]}],"name":"url"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The site’s ID in Matomo, from its Websites settings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"siteID"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The custom dimension each property is sent as, by the property’s name, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"made in Matomo’s Custom Dimensions settings; a property it doesn’t name is never sent.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"dimensions"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every event’s category, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"e_c"},{"type":"text","text":", such as the app’s name. Each event’s action,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"e_a"},{"type":"text","text":", is its name."}]}],"name":"category"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracking plan of every event the destination is given.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"plan"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What sends each request."}]}],"name":"transport"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"How long to wait before each new attempt at a request; 1 second, doubling up","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to 60 seconds, by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"backoff"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clock the waits are measured on."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"clock"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The wall-clock time a batch is encoded at, which the 23 hours are measured from,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and each request’s deadline is checked against before it is sent; the system’s clock by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default. When i